    <div class="ba"><img src={img("colour-before")} alt="Prototype 1 in blue and orange" loading="lazy" /><p class="fb"><small>Client feedback · The colours</small>With these colours it looks more suited to the Indian market than the international market.</p><span class="arr" aria-hidden="true">→</span><figure><img src={img("colour-after")} alt="Final penguin mat in greys with mustard" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>Final: greys with mustard</figcaption></figure></div>
